<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Join Us - Referral Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Hi {{userName}},</h2>
        <p>You've been invited to join our platform by a friend!</p>
        <p>Click the button below to create your account:</p>
        <a href="{{referralLink}}" class="button">Create Account</a>
        <p>Or copy and paste this link in your browser:</p>
        <p>{{referralLink}}</p>
        <p>This invitation will expire in 24 hours.</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Team</p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 